# Every synth track on pluck at once: bass 2, lead 3, arp 2, chord 4 voices = 11 lines from the shared pool of 13,
# with steals inside the tracks. Each voice keeps its own line: every note rings at its own pitch.
tempo 120
steps 16
tail 2.0
track bass
preset 50 120 0 0 255 30 0 0 128 0 128 180 0 0 0 0 0 0
note 0 C2 4 110
note 4 G1 4 110
note 8 A1 4 110
note 12 F1 4 110
track lead
preset 75 150 0 0 255 60 0 0 128 0 128 160 0 0 0 0 0 0
note 0 E4 8 100
note 0 G4 8 100
note 0 C5 8 100
note 8 F4 8 100
note 8 A4 8 100
note 8 C5 8 100
track arp
preset 176 90 0 0 255 60 0 0 128 0 128 160 0 0 0 0 0 0
note 0 C6 1 100
note 2 G5 1 100
note 4 E6 1 100
note 6 C6 1 100
note 8 A5 1 100
note 10 E6 1 100
note 12 F5 1 100
note 14 C6 1 100
track chord
preset 128 165 0 0 255 70 0 0 128 0 128 130 0 0 0 0 0 0
note 0 C3 8 90
note 0 E3 8 90
note 0 G3 8 90
note 0 B3 8 90
note 8 F3 8 90
note 8 A3 8 90
note 8 C4 8 90
note 8 E4 8 90
expect sound 0 16
expect idle 40
expect peak_below 0
